/Title (This brief is the third in a five-part CGIAR- OPPD- SAWONET policy brief series drawing on key informant interviews with pastoralist women-led, humanitarian, climate-resilience and peacebuilding organizations across Kenya, Somalia, Tanzania and South Africa. It builds on the flagship brief's overarching findings \(Brief 1\) and the adaptation-leadership evidence in Brief 2 and precedes companion briefs on pastoral mobility through a GESI lens and the alignment of education systems with pastoral mobility.)
/Dest [24 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 682 0 R
>>
