1217 0 obj
<<
/Title (Women are already active as informal peacebuilders, mediating family, and community disputes, running peace caravans, and mobilizing communities against violence.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1215 0 R
/Next 1221 0 R
>>
endobj
1218 0 obj
<<
/Title (Meaningful participation requires more than invitations to meetings. Rather it requires enforceable rights, voice, information, finance and decision-making authority.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1215 0 R
/Prev 1222 0 R
>>
endobj
1219 0 obj
<<
